title: Beetle Nest
portrait left: seeker

You spot a reflection of light behind some books. Leaning in you see two shining relics, but 3 large beetles seem to be sleeping on them. 

choice:
  - Reach for the relics -> fight
  - Leave them on the shelf -> leave

